      Z←B
      ∇





      ∇Z←N34
      'N34 called'
      Z←3
      ∇





      B←0





      (B←7) +
SYNTAX ERROR+
      (B←7)+
           ^


      B
0




      A←5 + (B←6) +
SYNTAX ERROR+
      A←5+(B←6)+
               ^


      B
0




      →(B←8) +
SYNTAX ERROR+
      →(B←8)+
            ^


      B
0




      F34 5 +
SYNTAX ERROR+
      F34 5+
           ^


      R←N34 +
SYNTAX ERROR+
      R←N34+
           ^


      (B←7) ,[1]
SYNTAX ERROR+
      (B←7),[1]
            ^


      B
0




      2 F34¨
SYNTAX ERROR+
      2 F34¨
           ^


      +/2 3
5




      R←N34
N34 called




      R
3




      )SIC





      )ERASE F34 N34 R B





