      ⍝ Bugs37 #52/#55: ⎕FIO[55] and ⎕FIO[61]
      ⍝





      '%f' ⎕FIO[55] 'e'





      ⎕FIO[61] 2017 4294967297
DOMAIN ERROR+
      ⎕FIO[61]2017 4294967297
      ^


      ⍝ ⎕FIO[61] uses the local time zone, so compare with an integer B
      ⍝ rather than with a fixed number of seconds (Bill Heagy)
      ⍝
      (⎕FIO[61] 2017 1.0 1) = ⎕FIO[61] 2017 1 1
1




      )SIC





