⎕FIO scanf: the number 11111111111111111111…1111111111 (500 characters) in B is out of range




      '%d' ⎕FIO[55] 30⍴'9'
DOMAIN ERROR+
      '%d' ⎕FIO[55]30⍴'9'
      ^    ^


      '%f' ⎕FIO[55] '1E¯400'
0





